<Base title="Accessibility" keyword="yay nyc accessibility" description="YaY NYC accessibility: our commitment to a site that works for everyone, and how to report a barrier so we can fix it.">
  <h1>Accessibility at YaY NYC</h1>
  <p>We want YaY NYC to work for everyone. We aim for WCAG 2.1 level AA: real buttons and links that work with a keyboard, visible focus, text contrast of at least 4.5:1, labels on every form field, and maps that always have a list next to them.</p>
  <p>Where we know it, a page notes step-free entrances, accessible subway stations and strobe lighting at parties. If something on the site is hard to use, <a href="/contact">tell us</a> and we will fix it.</p>
</Base>
